OL,3,AApple ordered to pay $5.7bn after
OL,4,Alosing vibration tech patent suit
OL,5,
OL,6,FApple has been approached for comment.
OL,7,FIn a statement given to news outlets
OL,8,Fincluding CNBC, the company said it had
OL,9,Fnot used Taction's vibration tech and
OL,10,Fwould appeal the verdict.
